{"event": "span_end", "trace_id": "trace_f33bb4f266734c4f955c5ed7490ac4cc", "span_id": "span_86e2da9b6c554ef381e822a3", "parent_id": "span_a23204bce9954bfcb4e1a4c4", "type": "Generation", "depth": 3, "duration": 652975.4, "detail": "\u2192 output: [{'content': '{\"short_summary\":\"A detailed, 1\\u202f600\u2011word markdown report that profiles Nigeria\u2019s leading armoured\u2011vehicle firms in 2026 \u2013 DICON, Dyon\\u202fX\\u202fShield, Innoson\\u202fVehicle\\u202fManufacturing, Imperium\\u202fIndustries, Proforce\\u202fDefence and others \u2013 and examines the legal, strategic and market context, joint\u2011venture arrangements, product portfolios, production data, challenges and future outlook, with tables, SWOT analyses and references to the supplied research.\",\"markdown_report\":\"\\\\n# Top Defence Companies in Nigeria Specialising in Armoured Vehicles \u2013 2026\\\\n\\\\n**Prepared for:**\\u202fStakeholders interested in Nigeria\u2019s indigenous defence\u2011manufacturing ecosystem (government agencies, investors, OEMs, security forces)  \\\\n**Prepared by:**\\u202fSenior Research Analyst \u2013 Defence Industry Unit  \\\\n**Date:**\\u202f13\\u202fAugust\\u202f2026\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## Table of Contents\\\\n1. [Executive Summary](#executive-summary) \\\\n2. [Research Methodology & Sources](#research-methodology--sources) \\\\n3. [Strategic Context \u2013 Nigeria\u2019s Defence Self\u2011Reliance Drive](#strategic-context--nigerias-defence-self-reliance-drive) \\\\n4. [Regulatory & Institutional Framework (DICON Act 2023)](#regulatory--institutional-framework-dicon-act-2023) \\\\n5. [Landscape of Armoured\u2011Vehicle Suppliers (2026)](#landscape-of-armoured-vehicle-suppliers-2026) \\\\n   - 5.1 State\u2011Owned / Semi\u2011Public Entities\\\\n   - 5.2 Private Domestic Manufacturers\\\\n   - 5.3 International Partnerships & Joint Ventures\\\\n6. [Company Profiles \u2013 Deep Dives](#company-profiles--deep-dives) \\\\n   - 6.1 Defence Industries Corporation of Nigeria (DICON)\\\\n   - 6.2 Dyon\\u202fX\\u202fShield (and X\u2011Shield Solution Ltd.)\\\\n   - 6.3 Innoson Vehicle Manufacturing (IVM)\\\\n   - 6.4 Imperium Industries Nigeria Ltd.\\\\n   - 6.5 Proforce Defence\\\\n   - 6.6 Epail Nigeria (light\u2011combat vehicle unit) \\\\n7. [Product Portfolio Matrix](#product-portfolio-matrix) \\\\n8. [Market Performance & Production Highlights (2024\u20112026)](#", "logged_at": "2026-08-13T10:48:53.678972+00:00"}
